
Section
Tag="ENG"

[MapSettings]
LegendMap="10 March 2008, 11:20 PM|Gdynia, Poland||THE CLUB, an exclusive venue, where the political and economic élites of Hokkaido meet up.|| 1 on 1 ESL verison || by damian3k"
LegendMapInBrief="1. SAUNA-sector 2||2. JACUZZI-sector 2||3. TEA ROOM-sector 1||4. LUNCH ROOM-sector 1||5. HALL-sector 1,2||6. GARDEN- sector 1,2"
ExpliMapInBriefSpy="Our recent discoveries have aroused our interest in the CLUB, an establishment frequented by the economic élites of Hokkaido. A criminal organization is hacking into the Club's computer system to disrupt part of the Polish economy. CLUB security has recently been entrusted to the ARGUS PMC company, and we know about its close links with the criminal world. Your mission is to infiltrate THE CLUB and put a stop to this hacking."
ExpliMapInBriefSentry="One of our Polish customers offered us the security contract for the Club at Gdynia. It is a meeting-place for the local élite. Our customer has dropped off attaché cases which he uses to retrieve information about the Club's network, and he seems to attach great importance to them. We also attach great importance to maintaining good relations with this customer. Your task is to protect our customer's installations against any malicious acts."
ModesStrings=((ExplicationModeSpy§(6553)="Reach two of the six mission objectives to put a stop to the network hacking.",ExplicationModeSentry§(6550)="Protect the objectives and neutralize the intruders.",ExpliModeInBriefSpy§(6554)="THE CLUB is located at the top of a tower. It has two levels and an exterior garden with a glass roof, which can be opened by hacking into a panel. Your objectives are the computer terminals used to hack into the network and steal the confidential data. Deactivate two of the six terminals.",LegendModeInBriefSpy§(6555)="The spies must accomplish a certain number of mission objectives. The latter can be of three kinds. The mercenaries must prevent them, or eliminate the spies.",ExpliModeInBriefSentry§(6551)="THE CLUB is located at the top of a tower. It has two levels and an external garden. The glass roof of the garden can apparently be opened by hacking into a panel, so be highly vigilant. It is essential for you to protect these terminals. Sufficiently skillful intruders can use certain elements in the CLUB to counter security, i.e. you. Keep your eyes peeled!",LegendModeInBriefSentry§(6552)="The spies must accomplish a certain number of mission objectives. The latter can be of three kinds. The mercenaries must prevent them, or eliminate the spies."),(ExplicationModeSpy§(6553)="Find and keep the data disks.",ExplicationModeSentry§(6550)="Prevent the intruders from seizing the data disks.",ExpliModeInBriefSpy§(6554)="THE CLUB is located at the top of a tower. It has two levels and an exterior garden, the glass roof of which can be opened by hacking into a box.",LegendModeInBriefSpy§(6555)="The spies must go through the level and get their hands on a certain number of disks. The mercenaries must prevent them, or eliminate the spies.",ExpliModeInBriefSentry§(6551)="THE CLUB is located at the top of a tower. It has two levels and an external garden. The glass roof of the garden can apparently be opened by hacking into a panel, so be highly vigilant. Sufficiently skillful intruders can use certain elements in the CLUB to counter security, i.e. you. Keep your eyes peeled!",LegendModeInBriefSentry§(6552)="The spies must go through the level and get their hands on a certain number of disks. The mercenaries must prevent them, or eliminate the spies."),(ExplicationModeSpy§(6553)="Eliminate all of the members of the ARGUS PMC who are present.",ExplicationModeSentry§(6550)="Eliminate all intruders seeking to infiltrate the CLUB. ",ExpliModeInBriefSpy§(6554)="THE CLUB is located at the top of a tower. It has two levels and an exterior garden, the glass roof of which can be opened by hacking into a box.",ExpliModeInBriefSpy§(6555)="The spies, like the mercenaries, must eliminate the opposing team entirely.",ExpliModeInBriefSentry§(6551)="THE CLUB is located at the top of a tower. It has two levels and an external garden. The glass roof of the garden can apparently be opened by hacking into a panel, so be highly vigilant. Sufficiently skillful intruders can use certain elements in the CLUB to counter security, i.e. you. Keep your eyes peeled!",LegendModeInBriefSentry§(6552)="The spies, like the mercenaries, must eliminate the opposing team entirely."))
